==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Gummy Cat (Enemy)|Gummy Cat]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Gummy Cat (Enemy)|Gummy Cat]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] to knock Gummy Cat behind Chickful A, then deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to kill the Chickful As. If Bahamut dies, don't worry. Just stall with Artist Cat until you can deploy him again.

